            <ArticleTitle>[Eosinophilic enteritis as a cause of acute abdomen].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>241-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a new case of eosinophilic enteritis whose first manifestation was acute abdomen and the diagnosis was done postoperatively. After surgery the patient hasn't had recurrence of the symptoms and he hasn't required esteroids.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
